1. Objective: Generate a 10-section SEO-optimized blog outline for the keyword {{"type":"in","path":"ask_user_target_keyword","title":"Target Keyword"}} tailored for {{"type":"in","path":"ask_user_target_audience","title":"Target Audience"}} using a {{"type":"in","path":"ask_user_writing_tone","title":"Writing Tone"}} tone. Evaluate the generated outline against SEO best practices and assign a score from 1 to 10. If the evaluation score is less than 8, perform internal iterations to improve the outline until it reaches a score of at least 8. Use generate_text for the creation and evaluation process.

2. Output Format: Provide the final 10-section blog outline, the final SEO score, and a summary of the SEO optimizations applied. The output must be plain text without any markdown formatting such as bolding, italics, or headers.

3. User Input / Context:
Target Keyword: {{"type":"in","path":"ask_user_target_keyword","title":"Target Keyword"}}
Target Audience: {{"type":"in","path":"ask_user_target_audience","title":"Target Audience"}}
Writing Tone: {{"type":"in","path":"ask_user_writing_tone","title":"Writing Tone"}}

1. Objective: Write the first two sections of a blog article using the provided outline and SEO instructions. Ensure each section is at least 175 words long. Every paragraph must be a maximum of 3 sentences. You must include at least one bulleted list in each section. Maintain the specified writing tone throughout. Avoid generic filler words or repetitive sentence structures. Ensure the target keyword is integrated naturally.

2. Output Format: Provide the text for the two sections in plain text. Do not use markdown headers or bolding. Verify that each section meets the word count and paragraph length requirements before completion.

3. User Input / Context:
Target Keyword: {{"type":"in","path":"ask_user_target_keyword","title":"Target Keyword"}}
Outline and SEO: {{"type":"in","path":"node_step_outline_and_seo","title":"Generate And Validate Outline"}}
Writing Tone: {{"type":"in","path":"ask_user_writing_tone","title":"Writing Tone"}}

Objective: Write sections three and four of the blog article. You must incorporate the keyword {{"type":"in","path":"ask_user_target_keyword","title":"Target Keyword"}} and strictly follow the structural and SEO constraints defined in {{"type":"in","path":"node_step_outline_and_seo","title":"Generate And Validate Outline"}}. The content must be written in the specific {{"type":"in","path":"ask_user_writing_tone","title":"Writing Tone"}} provided.

Output Format: Provide the written content for sections three and four only. Ensure the formatting matches the stylistic requirements mentioned in the context. Use the system_objective_fulfilled tool once the sections are completed.

User Input / Context:
Target Keyword: {{"type":"in","path":"ask_user_target_keyword","title":"Target Keyword"}}
Outline and SEO Constraints: {{"type":"in","path":"node_step_outline_and_seo","title":"Generate And Validate Outline"}}
Writing Tone: {{"type":"in","path":"ask_user_writing_tone","title":"Writing Tone"}}

Objective: Write sections five and six of the blog article based on the provided outline, target keyword, and writing tone. Ensure that all stylistic and formatting constraints specified in the outline and SEO instructions are strictly followed.

Output Format: Provide the text for sections five and six. Verify that the content aligns with the specified tone and SEO requirements. You are done when you have generated the complete text for both sections.

User Input / Context:
Target Keyword: {{"type":"in","path":"ask_user_target_keyword","title":"Target Keyword"}}
