Writing Tone: {{"type":"in","path":"ask_user_writing_tone","title":"Writing Tone"}}

Objective: Write sections seven and eight of the blog article. Ensure the content adheres to the provided SEO outline, incorporates the target keyword naturally, and maintains the specified writing tone while following all stylistic and formatting constraints.

Output Format: Provide the text for sections seven and eight in plain text. Verify that the target keyword is included and that the writing style matches the user's requirements.

